      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 22,
      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive clinical team and receptionists"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners widely commend vets and nurses such as Sarah and Tom alongside reception staff for their warm, empathetic, and reassuring manner. Clients appreciate that staff listen carefully to health concerns and make nervous animals feel welcome. A few reviewers reported occasional curtness at the front desk, but the overwhelming majority highlight a caring team."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Comforting approach for anxious pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients praise the clinic's gentle, patient handling of difficult or fearful animals, including nervous French bulldogs and elderly cats. Reviewers note that staff handle pets tenderly during injections and examinations, creating a calm atmosphere that builds trust. Owners express high confidence leaving their companion animals in the practice's care."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Reliable check-ups and routine procedures"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most clients report successful outcomes for spaying operations, paw injuries, routine health assessments, and prescription management. Reviewers mention that pets recover smoothly following surgical treatments and routine check-ups. While one owner complained about an unsatisfactory cat grooming session, most reviews express satisfaction with medical care."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can the practice accommodate pets that are fearful or difficult to examine?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients frequently note that veterinary staff remain patient, gentle, and calm with nervous or snappy dogs and cats."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What procedures are performed at Medivet Battersea?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The clinic provides routine check-ups, pet vaccinations, neutering surgery, dental cleanings, radiography, and emergency stabilisation."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How are phone bookings and communication managed?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "While in-person visits run smoothly, some reviewers noted extended hold times on the phone when contacting reception during peak morning hours."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    }
